# This registry is intentionally an AST-readable literal.  The immutable CRN
# consumer contract is derived from these bytes instead of accepting an
# operator-authored list of purported applications.  No stochastic magnitude
# was frozen for four of the six streams, so inventing one here would silently
# change the experiment.  Those channels therefore have an explicit, enforced
# zero-amplitude mapping.  ``applied`` means that both active mappings and all
# inactive-zero constraints were enforced, not that every stream injected
# non-zero noise.
